    "About": {
      "title": "ABOUT",
      "p1_bold": "Song Tien Driving Training & Testing Center",
      "p1_rest": "covers over 22,000 m². The practice and testing area spans more than 11,000 m²—the largest in Tien Giang—meeting Vietnam’s National Level II testing standards. It is licensed to conduct driving tests for car licenses (B, C1, C) and motorbike licenses (A1, A). Located near My Tho city center, it is an ideal place for students from Tien Giang and neighboring provinces to study and take license exams.",
      "p2": "We commit to a transparent, all-inclusive tuition fee—no hidden charges. Students receive free learning materials and a complete training program in accordance with regulations: Theory, Simulation, Cabin Simulation, On-yard practice, On-road practice, etc. In addition, students can practice with real test vehicles right on the official test yard and receive pre-exam coaching from instructors.",
